      "role": "user",
      "content": "exactly. so basically, if we accept that regulators have the power to label stuff as \"misinformation,\" we've already lost the battle for free speech. isn't it basically true then that any regulation under the guise of \"safety\" or \"truth\" is just a way for the government to control the narrative?",
